OL,3,GNEWSA'Stunning' sculpture could replace
OL,4,AM5 Willow Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 26-year-old sculpture which has
OL,7,Ffallen into disrepair could be replaced
OL,8,Fwith a "stunning" carnival alternative.
OL,10,FThe Willow Man, near the M5 in
OL,11,FBridgwater, Somerset, has drastically
OL,12,Fdeteriorated since the 40ft (12m)
OL,13,Flandmark was created in 2000.
OL,15,FBridgwater Without Parish Council has
OL,16,Fvoted in principle to tear down the
OL,17,Fremaining structure and replace it with
OL,18,Fa willow Squibber Man.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
