OL,3,GNEWSA'Stunning' sculpture could replace
OL,4,AM5 Willow Man
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Gary Bond said the town
OL,7,Falready has a small willow sculpture of
OL,8,Fa squibber in its centre. "If you could
OL,9,Fmake that ten times bigger than it is,
OL,10,Fthat would look stunning," he added.
